{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459900/extras/MONITOR.gif?t=1741942962\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as an agent working for the <strong>A.M.C.A.</strong>, you're tasked with <strong>monitoring</strong> places where unusual occurrences have been previously reported and report any abnormalities you spot on the cameras, as well as dealing with any entities that are deemed threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be sent to various locations, each with no less than 8 cameras to pay attention to, with more threats being introduced as you progress, until you finally reach <strong>where it all began</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your shift lasts for 6 hours, from 12AM to 6AM (<strong>15 real life minutes</strong>), you must stay on edge throughout all 6 of these hours, otherwise, <strong>you'll face the consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failure to report all active anomalies will result in a <strong>75%</strong> dock from your payment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No breaks, and good luck, you'll need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Finding and reporting anomalies using the cams.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Multiple threats</strong> on and off the cameras.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>8</strong> <strong>Levels</strong> (<strong>5 </strong>on release).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<strong>Challenges</strong> for each level.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Possibly a custom night for the final level.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NOTES\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor is inspired by <strong>I'm on Observation Duty</strong> and <strong>Five 